id: vocation-training
name: Vocation Training
order: 2
category: mind
importance: primary
# (2) A Vocation chosen as it is gained, and gone with it (racial.mjs grantOtherTrait) - an Other Trait, as Evolution
# Traits are (the user's).
grantsOther: vocation
description: >
  Trained to work in teams to cover each others’ weaknesses, Konatsians take on specialized combat roles.
text: >
  Vocation Training (Mind): Trained to work in teams to cover each others’ weaknesses, Konatsians take on specialized combat roles.
  (1)-[Passive]: At Character Creation, gain access to a Talent from the Physical Attack, Energy Attack, Magic Attack, or Weapon Talent Category that you meet the Prerequisites for.
  (2)-[Passive]: At Character Creation, select and gain access to a Vocation of your choice.

---

# (2) A Vocation, chosen as this is gained - its header's `grantsOther`. Vocations are Other Traits, in their own group of
# the Other Traits list (traits/other/vocation/), any race's.

# --- What is not built, and why ---------------------------------------------------
#
# (1) A Talent of the Physical Attack, Energy Attack, Magic Attack or Weapon Talent Category: no Talent here says which
#     Category it is of, and most are not written yet. Taken by hand from the Talents list for now.
